pan class=\"lb\"><b>納戸</b><span>Nando · 8×</span></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"5\" style=\"--m:100%\"><span class=\"sw\"></span><span class=\"lb\"><b>褐</b><span>Kachi · 12×</span></span></button></div><div class=\"az-shade-info\" id=\"az-si\"></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"az-line\">How to choose</div><table class=\"az-tbl\"><tr><th>Use</th><th>Suggested shade</th><th>Why</th></tr><tr><td>Kitchen linen</td><td>Asagi · 浅葱</td><td>Shows stains less, washes clean, stays light.</td></tr><tr><td>Everyday bag</td><td>Nando · 納戸</td><td>Hides wear and keeps colour under sun.</td></tr><tr><td>Gift</td><td>Hanada · 縹</td><td>The classic: reads as indigo immediately.</td></tr><tr><td>Summer shirt</td><td>Mizuhanada · 水縹</td><td>Light enough to feel cool.</td></tr></table></section><script>(function(){var D=[{\"jp\": \"瓶覗\", \"en\": \"Kamenozoki\", \"n\": 1, \"d\": \"Barely there. The cloth is dipped once and lifted quickly, leaving the pale blue of sky seen in the bottom of a vat.\", \"t\": \"A glimpse into the jar.\"}, {\"jp\": \"水縹\", \"en\": \"Mizuhanada\", \"n\": 2, \"d\": \"Water-flower blue. Light enough for summer shirts and tenugui that should feel airy.\", \"t\": \"Water-flower.\"}, {\"jp\": \"浅葱\", \"en\": \"Asagi\", \"n\": 3, \"d\": \"Spring-onion blue. Our most requested shade for aprons, napkins and light table linen.\", \"t\": \"Leek-green blue.\"}, {\"jp\": \"縹\", \"en\": \"Hanada\", \"n\": 5, \"d\": \"The classic indigo of everyday work clothes. Reads as clear blue in daylight and deep blue under lamps.\", \"t\": \"The everyday indigo.\"}, {\"jp\": \"納戸\", \"en\": \"Nando\", \"n\": 8, \"d\": \"Closet-dark. Used for noren curtains and bags, where the colour needs to hold against sun and wear.\", \"t\": \"Colour of the storeroom.\"}, {\"jp\": \"褐\", \"en\": \"Kachi\", \"n\": 12, \"d\": \"So dark it is almost black. Once the colour of victory worn under armour, now our deepest lot.\", \"t\": \"The victory colour.\"}];var root=document.querySelector(\".az-shades\");if(!root)return;var bs=root.querySelectorAll(\"button\"),o=document.getElementById(\"az-si\");function pick(i){bs.forEach(function(b,j){b.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\",j===i)});var s=D[i];o.innerHTML=\"<div class=big>\"+s.jp+\"</div><p><b>\"+s.en+\"</b> — \"+s.d+\"</p><div class=dip><b>\"+s.n+\"</b>dips in the vat</div>\"}bs.forEach(function(b,i){b.onclick=function(){pick(i)}});pick(3)})();</script>","cart":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Cart</b></div><h1>カート</h1></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"az-cartwrap\"><table class=\"az-tbl\"><tr><th>Item</th><th>Qty</th><th>Price</th></tr><tr><td><b>Hanada tenugui</b><br><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px\">Mizuhanada · 34 × 90</span></td><td>2</td><td>RM 96</td></tr><tr><td><b>Linen apron</b><br><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px\">Hanada · M</span></td><td>1</td><td>RM 238</td></tr><tr><td><b>Sashiko coasters</b><br><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px\">Asagi · set of 4</span></td><td>1</td><td>RM 78</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"az-sum\"><div><span>Subtotal</span><span>RM 412</span></div><div><span>Delivery</span><span>Free</span></div><div class=\"t\"><span>Total</span><span>RM 412</span></div><a class=\"az-btn\" href=\"#\">CHECKOUT · お会計</a><p style=\"font-size:13px;opacity:.7\">Each piece is dyed to order. Ships in 5 working days.</p></div></div></section>","story":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Our dye house</b></div><h1>染工房</h1><p class=lead>A converted rice mill, eight vats and four people. We dye what we sell, and we sell what we dye.</p></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"az-story\"><div class=\"az-ph\" data-l=\"Workshop interior (缺图)\"></div><div><div class=\"az-line\">Since 2019</div><h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Slow colour.</h2><p style=\"line-height:2;max-width:46ch\">We started with one vat and a borrowed book. Today we keep eight, each named after the month it was started. The oldest, in its seventh year, produces the deepest, most even blue we know.</p><p style=\"line-height:2;max-width:46ch;margin-top:18px\">Replace this copy with your workshop's real history, people and place.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"az-line\">What we hold to</div><div class=\"az-steps\"><div><span class=\"n\">一</span><h3>Natural indigo only</h3><p>No synthetic shortcuts, no pre-reduced powder.</p></div><div><span class=\"n\">二</span><h3>Small lots</h3><p>No more than 60 pieces from one dip.</p></div><div><span class=\"n\">三</span><h3>Mend, don't discard</h3><p>Free re-dye on any piece, any age.</p></div><div><span class=\"n\">四</span><h3>Honest labels</h3><p>Dip counts printed on every tag.</p></div></div></section>","care":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Care guide</b></div><h1>手入れ</h1><p class=lead>Indigo is a living colour. A few habits keep it blue for years.</p></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"az-steps\"><div><span class=\"n\">01</span><h3>Wash alone</h3><p>For the first three washes, in cold water, with a neutral soap.</p></div><div><span class=\"n\">02</span><h3>No bleach</h3><p>Not even oxygen bleach. It strips the blue.</p></div><div><span class=\"n\">03</span><h3>Dry in shade</h3><p>Direct sun fades indigo unevenly.</p></div><div><span class=\"n\">04</span><h3>Re-dye</h3><p>Send it back. We will bring the colour up again.</p></div></div></section>","journal":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Journal</b></div><h1>日記</h1></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><a class=\"az-post\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.09.28</time><h3>Why the first wash is the best wash</h3><span class=\"tg\">Care</span></a><a class=\"az-post\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.09.10</time><h3>A morning at the vat: counting dips</h3><span class=\"tg\">Studio</span></a><a class=\"az-post\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.08.19</time><h3>Mending boro with the kids' old jeans</h3><span class=\"tg\">Craft</span></a><a class=\"az-post\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.07.30</time><h3>Meet the indigo farmer in Tokushima</h3><span class=\"tg\">People</span></a><a class=\"az-post\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.06.12</time><h3>Summer linen, in three blues</h3><span class=\"tg\">Season</span></a></section>","contact":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Contact</b></div><h1>お問い合わせ</h1></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"az-pdp\"><form class=\"form\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr\"><div class=\"fld\"><span>Name</span><input></div><div class=\"fld\"><span>Email</span><input type=\"email\"></div><div class=\"fld\"><span>Topic</span><select><option>Order</option><option>Custom dyeing</option><option>Wholesale</option></select></div><div class=\"fld\"><span>Message</span><textarea rows=\"5\"></textarea></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"az-btn\">SEND</button></form><div><div class=\"az-lbl\">Workshop &amp; shop</div><p style=\"line-height:2;margin:10px 0 24px\">12 Jalan Contoh, 50000 Kuala Lumpur<br>Wed – Sun · 11:00 – 18:00</p><div class=\"az-lbl\">Email</div><p style=\"margin-top:10px\">hello@example.com</p></div></div></section>","shipping":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Shipping & returns</b></div><h1>配送・返品</h1></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><table class=\"az-tbl\"><tr><th>Region</th><th>Time</th><th>Cost</th></tr><tr><td>Malaysia</td><td>3–5 working days</td><td>RM 12 · free over RM 250</td></tr><tr><td>Singapore</td><td>5–7 working days</td><td>RM 28</td></tr><tr><td>Rest of world</td><td>7–14 working days</td><td>At checkout</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:28px;max-width:60ch;line-height:1.9\">Returns within 14 days if unused and unwashed. Custom-shade pieces cannot be returned, but can be re-dyed.</p></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1>よくある質問</h1></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Will indigo stain my skin or clothes?</summary><p>Slightly, in the first washes. Wash alone and the transfer fades.</p></details><details><summary>Can I request a specific shade?</summary><p>Yes. Choose one of the six shades or send us a swatch. Allow 10 working days.</p></details><details><summary>Do you do wholesale?</summary><p>Yes, minimum 20 pieces. Use the contact form.</p></details><details><summary>Is it vegan?</summary><p>Yes. Indigo is plant-based; our vat uses wood ash and wheat bran.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1>Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"az-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(80px,12vw,180px)\"><div class=\"az-seal\" style=\"margin:0 auto 26px;width:56px;height:56px;font-size:30px\">藍</div><div class=\"az-line\" style=\"justify-content:center\">Error 404</div><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(60px,12vw,160px)\